5:21:21Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123573\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThis patch changes the order of instructions in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp#L3171-L3175 to get the actual name of the child node with `child->get_name()` to correct the name casing before prevalidating and setting it with set_name(). Resulting with the child node's name having the corresponding suffix and numbering before it is added.\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\nTestNode → test_node\r\nenters as test_node2\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\nTestNode → test_node2\r\nenters as test_node2\r\n\r\nUsed some AI to find the bug's root cause, first checking in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/main/node.cpp and finally in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp to not rewrite the already existing architecture. Afterwards it proposed and developed the fix to the corresponding code paths.\r\nAfter testing with different options for the `editor/naming/node_name_casing` setting, changing the `class_name` \"Test\" to \"test\" and using the multi-word \"TestNode\" name, i can say that the behavior is correct from a technical and practical standpoint now.\r\nConstructive comments are welcomed.\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123637/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123637/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}